  "releaseNotes": "0.3.1\n\nFixed\n- A text box's clear button takes the quiet icon-button look (a soft fill under the pointer, a small press), inset from the field's end with the inner radius, and keeps its own size inside an input group.\n- MonthCalendar's week and day grids draw their lines in the hairline.\n\nAdded\n- DescriptionList num: every value reads as a figure (left to right, at the start), the pairs made from ItemsSource included.\n\nThe full list of 0.3.0 changes is on the 0.3.0 release.",
